    "detailed_description": "<strong>Piggy'sGreat Adventure is a simulation RPG.</strong><br>Piggy, a little dragon, and Simon, a human boy, are adventuring in a fantasy world where dragons, <br>elves, orcs, and other various races live.<br>Simon and his friends have more than 40 unique characters to choose from.<br>Simon and his friends grow up with more than 40 unique units <br>and fight fierce battles against an army of demons led by green demons (orcs).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/114f882d283cde749e5c8b04f620d45d.avif?t=1709778672\" width=560 height=390 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nemesis Orcs</h2><br><br>On the Mede continent, where Simon and his friends live, various demons lurk.<br>Orcs are particularly vicious, attacking humans and gathering in the darkness to plot against them.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/c39be93b8e8376cf34978d2d7a1b80b2.avif?t=1709778672\" width=560 height=390 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><br>The units that join you are gorgeously drawn and have their own unique fighting style.<br>They defeat their enemies in their own unique fighting style. As they gain experience and level up<br>As they gain experience and level up, their stats increase, and sometimes they learn skills or acquire special weapons.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/ce42024a8f0b80ff6c74ca04ad3aa0a3.poster.avif?t=1709778672\" width=560 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/ce42024a8f0b80ff6c74ca04ad3aa0a3.webm?t=1709778672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/ce42024a8f0b80ff6c74ca04ad3aa0a3.mp4?t=1709778672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various species</h2><br>There are many subhumans of various kinds living in this world.<br>They help us, but sometimes they may be hostile to us.<br>When they become allies, they become reassuring friends and play an active role.<br>More than 40 friends will join and help Simon and Piggy.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/86491db1a2f4479d6bc93b11cd5c152a.poster.avif?t=1709778672\" width=560 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/86491db1a2f4479d6bc93b11cd5c152a.webm?t=1709778672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/86491db1a2f4479d6bc93b11cd5c152a.mp4?t=1709778672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conclusion</h2><br>Weapons are expendable.<br>\u3000Weapons such as swords and bows handled by many units are  longer consumable.<br>\u3000Subhumans who deal in physical arts have an advantage in this regard, as they can unleash their fists indefinitely.<br>Class Change<br>\u3000Some characters can change classes by grabbing an adapted badge.<br>\u3000Some characters can change classes to bring out their full potential.<br><br>Uploading of play videos and secondary works are allowed within the bounds of decency. <br>You are free to do so within the bounds of common sense.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Piggy'sGreat Adventure is a simulation RPG.</strong><br>Piggy, a little dragon, and Simon, a human boy, are adventuring in a fantasy world where dragons, <br>elves, orcs, and other various races live.<br>Simon and his friends have more than 40 unique characters to choose from.<br>Simon and his friends grow up with more than 40 unique units <br>and fight fierce battles against an army of demons led by green demons (orcs).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/114f882d283cde749e5c8b04f620d45d.avif?t=1709778672\" width=560 height=390 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nemesis Orcs</h2><br><br>On the Mede continent, where Simon and his friends live, various demons lurk.<br>Orcs are particularly vicious, attacking humans and gathering in the darkness to plot against them.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/c39be93b8e8376cf34978d2d7a1b80b2.avif?t=1709778672\" width=560 height=390 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><br>The units that join you are gorgeously drawn and have their own unique fighting style.<br>They defeat their enemies in their own unique fighting style. As they gain experience and level up<br>As they gain experience and level up, their stats increase, and sometimes they learn skills or acquire special weapons.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/ce42024a8f0b80ff6c74ca04ad3aa0a3.poster.avif?t=1709778672\" width=560 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/ce42024a8f0b80ff6c74ca04ad3aa0a3.webm?t=1709778672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/ce42024a8f0b80ff6c74ca04ad3aa0a3.mp4?t=1709778672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various species</h2><br>There are many subhumans of various kinds living in this world.<br>They help us, but sometimes they may be hostile to us.<br>When they become allies, they become reassuring friends and play an active role.<br>More than 40 friends will join and help Simon and Piggy.<br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/86491db1a2f4479d6bc93b11cd5c152a.poster.avif?t=1709778672\" width=560 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/86491db1a2f4479d6bc93b11cd5c152a.webm?t=1709778672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791610/extras/86491db1a2f4479d6bc93b11cd5c152a.mp4?t=1709778672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conclusion</h2><br>Weapons are expendable.<br>\u3000Weapons such as swords and bows handled by many units are  longer consumable.<br>\u3000Subhumans who deal in physical arts have an advantage in this regard, as they can unleash their fists indefinitely.<br>Class Change<br>\u3000Some characters can change classes by grabbing an adapted badge.<br>\u3000Some characters can change classes to bring out their full potential.<br><br>Uploading of play videos and secondary works are allowed within the bounds of decency. <br>You are free to do so within the bounds of common sense.",
